<title>USA: Coach USA sells $150 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>Coach USA sells $150 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Coach USA Inc was priced late on Wednesday via Donaldson Lufkin and Jenrette, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Coach USA is the largest provider of motorcoach bus tours and charters in the U.S.</p>
<p>BORROWER COACH USA INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 9.375 PCT  MATURITY 7/1/07</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 1/1/98</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD 9.375 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD 296 BPS    CALLABLE NON CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES: THREE-YEAR EQUITY CLAWBACK FOR UP TO 33.33 PERCENT OF THE ISSUE AT 109.375 PCT. U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1662</p>
</text>
